#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:5 f0746eec70814b9e816d5a2679011db0
msgid "CIRCLE Mode"
msgstr "CIRCLE 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:7 c98ca51b2f374ac8b8aa35429e146b3b
msgid ""
"Circle mode is similar to :ref:`LOITER <loiter-mode>`, but doesn't attempt "
"to hold position. This is primarily meant to be used as an initial failsafe "
"mode to allow the vehicle to turn in order to hopefully regain radio control"
" signal and pilot control. See :ref:`failsafe documentation <apms-failsafe-"
"function>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Circle 模式与 :ref:`LOITER <loiter-mode>` "
"类似，但不尝试保持位置。该模式主要用作初始失控保护模式，允许飞行器转弯，以期重新获得无线电控制信号和飞手控制权。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`失控保护文档"
" <apms-failsafe-function>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:13 2db6165703a14d84997f2927ca12437b
msgid ""
"Circle mode is deliberately a very conservative mode, and doesn't rely on "
"GPS positioning as it is used when GPS fails. It will do a large circle, The"
" bank angle is set to the ``ROLL_LIMIT_DEG`` divided by 3, to try to ensure "
"the plane remains stable even without GPS velocity data for accelerometer "
"correction. That is why the circle radius is so large."
msgstr ""
"Circle 模式特意设计得非常保守，不依赖 GPS 定位，因为它在 GPS 失效时使用。它会做一个大圆，坡度角设置为 "
"``ROLL_LIMIT_DEG`` 除以 3，以确保即使没有用于加速度计校正的 GPS 速度数据，飞机也能保持稳定。这就是为什么圆半径如此之大的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:19 c27dc2006ec041a4a702ea8bb6ad0862
msgid ""
"Circle mode uses throttle and pitch control to maintain altitude at the "
"altitude where it started circling."
msgstr "Circle 模式使用油门和俯仰控制来维持开始盘旋时的高度。"
